{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10241100","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10241100","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1024110001:0":{"text":"돈이 꽤 많이 나갔네요...\n하지만 블레다크를 위해서라면 상관 없어요!","source_cn":"真是一笔不小的开销……\\n但为了布拉达克，一切都值得！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3AE46C679A9DC6C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1024110002:0":{"text":"이 정도의 돈을 쓸 가치가 있나요?","source_cn":"它真的值得你如此破费？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF47E650D0FC5D3D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1024110003:0":{"text":"블레다크는 제 소중한 친구니까요!\n돈으로 우정과 친구를 살 수는 없잖아요? ","source_cn":"布拉达克是我宝贵的伙伴！\\n钱怎么能买来友谊和陪伴呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x165B26C4BF01DAE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1024110004:0":{"text":"그거야 가격에 달려있긴 하지만... ","source_cn":"那要取决于价钱……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C95C26C74362864","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1024110005:0":{"text":"하지만 그건 어른의 세계예요, 도련님. 지금은 그렇게 믿고 계시라고요.","source_cn":"不过那是大人的世界，小少爷，你现在如此坚信就好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DECBC6D23FB92CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","doc